{
  "_comment": [
    "Section 5.4 microbenchmarks - Figures 14, 15, 16. All 12 experiments run",
    "Koala (lazy/by-key) on Nexmark Q6*",
    "Three sweeps, four experiments each:",
    "  state_*    - total state size 10/20/40/80 GB   -> Fig 14, Fig 15a",
    "  locality_* - active key space 500K/1M/2M/4M    -> Fig 16a",
    "  skew_*     - hot key ratio 0/25/50/75 %        -> Fig 16b",
    "",
    "Warm-up state must already exist on the worker nodes: every config here sets",
    "LoadWarmUpData=true and points at pebble_warmup_data/nexmark_q6_mod/ and",
    "pebbleLookUpTable/nexmark_q6_mod/.",
    "",
    "Runtime: 12 x ~11 min + 11 x 30s cooldown ~= 2h 20m (longer if retries fire)."
  ],

  "WorkDir": "~/disaggregated-streaming",

  "CooldownSeconds": 30,
  "MaxAttempts": 2,
  "RetryDelaySeconds": 60,
  "StopOnFailure": false,
  "GitFetch": false,
  "RestoreBranch": true,

  "Experiments": [
    {
      "Name": "state_10gb",
      "Branch": "main",
      "ConfigPath": "nexmarkJson/query6/stateSize/query6ModByKeyLazy10GB.json",
      "ResultKeyword": "lazy_5MKeys"
    },
    {
      "Name": "state_20gb",
      "Branch": "main",
